ROM -> RI : 5 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nPOST /resource\n(PCF profile, resourceStatus="standby")
RI --> ROM : 6 **TMF639** 201 PCF profile

ROM -> RAC : 7 **TMF702 Resource Activation**\nPOST /resource (PCF profile)
activate RAC
RAC --> ROM : 8 **TMF702** 201 PCF profile

RAC -> RCM : 9 **TMF634 Resource Catalog Management** GET /resourceSpecification (PCF API)
RCM --> RAC : 10 **TMF634** 200 PCF API specification

ROM -> RI : 11 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nGET /resource
RI --> ROM : 12 **TMF639** 200 API endpoint

RAC -> PCF : 13 **PCF API call** (PCF profile)
activate PCF
PCF --> RAC : 14 **PCF API call** response
deactivate PCF

RAC -> Event : 15 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event resourceStateChange\n(state="available")
deactivate RAC
activate Event
Event -> ROM : 16 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST listener/resourceStateChange\n(state="available")
deactivate Event

ROM -> RI : 17 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nPATCH /resource\n(PCRF profile, resourceStatus="available")
RI --> ROM : 18 **TMF639** 204

ROM -> RI : 19 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management** PATCH /resource\n(Logical SIM card, Number)
RI --> ROM : 20 **TMF639** 204

